  GRAPH narr:Tx_20250717T143000Z {
    narr:Narrative_PipelineSlugGeneration skos:note "The memory explicitly tests that the extraction pipeline can produce a slug from content — either via LLM id-gen or deterministic slugify fallback — and commit the file successfully when no id field is present in the frontmatter. A second E2E test (Box-Free Design Continuation 2) extends this to ## level headings and adds an explicit crash-prevention requirement: the pipeline must not crash on this payload pattern." .
  }
